  "rationale": "Setting --gencode true adds PREPROCESS_TRANSCRIPTS_FASTA_GENCODE, because a transcript FASTA is supplied. It also makes CUSTOM_CATADDITIONALFASTA write 'gene_type' instead of 'gene_biotype', so the regenerated genome FASTA, GTF and transcript FASTA force every downstream index, alignment, quantification and QC task to rerun; the prebuilt Salmon index is only untarred, so it is unaffected. biotypeQcUsable now looks for 'gene_type' on exon rows of the Ensembl-style test GTF, does not find it, and drops biotype QC, which removes featureCounts and the custom biotype MultiQC step."
